es40: es40 (AlphaServer ES40 emulator)
es40:
es40: ES40 is a fork of the es40 emulator.
es40: It could theoretically be used for running any operating system that
es40: runs on the OpenVMS or Tru64 PALcode e.g. OpenVMS, Windows 2000,
es40: Tru64 UNIX, Linux, NetBSD,..
es40:
es40: The emulator supports SCSI, sound, IDE, serial ports, Ethernet
es40: using pcap, or TUN/TAP on Linux and VGA graphics (using SDL3).
